<title>USA: First Federal Bancshares buy approved.</title>
<headline>First Federal Bancshares buy approved.</headline>
<dateline>EAU CLAIRE, Wis. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Federal Bancshares of Eau Claire Inc said Thursday its shareholders approved the company's acquisition by Mutual Savings Bank of Milwaukee in a deal valued at about $132 million.</p>
<p>First Federal holders will receive $18.85 in cash for each of their shares.  The deal is expected to close March 31.</p>
<p>The company is the parent of First Federal Bank of Eau Claire.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged Thursday at 18-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
